WEBVTT

00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:09.033
The workbench manages every layer on your map. First we add a layer, then look at its controls.

00:00:09.844 --> 00:00:12.453
Open Explore data.

00:00:13.114 --> 00:00:18.093
Search for a dataset, here the vegetation index.

00:00:19.399 --> 00:00:25.298
Add it to the map. It appears as a card in the workbench on the left.

00:00:37.093 --> 00:00:42.917
Disable All, Collapse All and Remove All act on every layer at once.

00:00:43.577 --> 00:00:47.311
Each layer has a switch to show or hide it.

00:00:47.968 --> 00:00:51.657
Ideal Zoom frames the layer on the map.

00:00:52.315 --> 00:00:56.624
About Data opens the layer's catalogue description.

00:00:57.289 --> 00:01:02.068
The three dot menu exports the layer, or removes it.

00:01:11.515 --> 00:01:18.099
Use the arrow on the card to open opacity, display variable and style controls.

00:01:18.757 --> 00:01:26.390
That is the workbench. Expand a card for opacity, styling and time controls.
